    <item>
      <title>I refuse to let Cancer win today . . .</title>
      <pubDate>Fri, 02 Oct 2026 00:02:38 +0000</pubDate>
      <link>https://www.rig-talk.com/forum/threads/i-refuse-to-let-cancer-win-today.341145/</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">urn:xenforo:thread:341145</guid>
      <author>invalid@example.com (HellraiserJohnny)</author>
      <category domain="https://www.rig-talk.com/forum/forums/rig-talk.3/"><![CDATA[Rig-Talk]]></category>
      <dc:creator>HellraiserJohnny</dc:creator>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="bbWrapper">I got a break between treatments for 2 weeks and am starting to feel like a human being again. Pulled out the racks and the cases (how my wife LoVes when that happens : ) and threw a little practice rig together so if I can get 1 or 2 hours a day in  . . . I can.<br />
<br />
Today&#039;s Score:<br />
